---
active: true
---
- ACTION6(x,y) changes exactly 2 cells at ((x+y)%64,63) and ((x+y+1)%64,63) on the bottom row y=63 (hyp.action6_marker)
END
WHY #1,#2,#3,#5,#8 all changed 2 cells at x=(x+y)%64,+1 on y63 regardless of target location; #9 changed 0 where those cells were already 0, consistent with a no-op when unchanged
EXPECT within 3 actions: an ACTION6 at a new (x,y) again changes exactly those two bottom-row cells
def check(t):
    if t['action'] != 'ACTION6':
        return None
    x = t.get('x'); y = t.get('y')
    if x is None or y is None:
        return None
    a = (x + y) % 64
    b = (a + 1) % 64
    before = t['before']; after = t['after']
    exp = {(a, 63), (b, 63)}
    got = set()
    for yy in range(64):
        for xx in range(64):
            if before[yy][xx] != after[yy][xx]:
                got.add((xx, yy))
    if got == exp:
        return True
    if not got or (got & exp) != got:
        return False
    return None
END

